]the one agent run that produced each file.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202607/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifacts_files_subtab.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-b0[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-b0/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Register the Files sub-tab across TUI plumbing[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]scaffold[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]scaffold: register `files` in the shared Artifacts sub-tab constants, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]compose a real-but-empty ArtifactsFilesPane on digit 6, and wire [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actions, gating, keymaps, copy-mode routing safety, marks state, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placeholder/onboarding/help/palette surfaces, and styles.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Files list, kind icons, and off-thread loading[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]list[dim] · [dim][/dim]after scaffold[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]list: load the index off-thread through the Rust-backed query facade [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with two-phase paging, render date-grouped rows with view-mode icons and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]origin badges, implement the shared entry-navigator contract with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stable-target cursor restore, and build the kind summary chips and hints[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]strip.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Files detail panel with reference, metadata, and liveness[/bold #D7AFFF]     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]detail[dim] · [dim][/dim]after list[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]detail: build the debounced, worker-backed detail panel — reference line[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]with resolved stored path, file metadata with graceful unenriched [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fallbacks and the doctor hint, origin sentence, path liveness badges, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and a bounded text preview for text-like rows.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Files filter bar, kind cycle, and in-memory filtering[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]filters[dim] · [dim][/dim]after list[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]filters: add the Files filter bar with kind/project/agent/workflow/ [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]origin/since/until tokens and free text, pure in-memory filtering over [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the loaded snapshot, completion sources, the s kind-cycle key, and the /[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]edit-query arm.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Smart open, viewer hand-off, external open, and agent jump[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]open-actions[dim] · [dim][/dim]after list[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]open-actions: implement smart enter dispatch — preview reader for [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]text-like files, rich terminal viewer for media — plus Z viewer hand-off[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]for one row or the marked set, o open-external, and a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]jump-to-producing-agent with revival.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Copy verbs, the % menu, and the file reference branch[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]copy-refs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after open-actions[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]copy-refs: give Files real copy verbs — y reference, Y anchored stored [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]path, a % copy menu with contents/path/source/label/JSON targets and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]marked-set support — extend reference_for_entry_target with a files [/#D7D7AF]\n